    "objective": "Execute the three basic cuts with sharp plants and clear targets.",
    "setup": "Passer at the top; cutters at the wing.",
    "organization": "Rotate cutter and passer.",
    "instructions": [
      "V-cut: walk toward the lane, plant the inside foot, push out to the wing and show a hand.",
      "L-cut: walk up the lane line to the elbow, plant and cut out to the wing in an L.",
      "Back cut: walk out toward the wing, plant the outside foot and cut to the rim.",
      "Receive the pass on each cut.",
      "Finish or shoot."
    ],
    "coachingPoints": [
      "Slow, then sharp: the plant makes the cut.",
      "Show a target on every cut.",
      "Eyes on the passer."
    ],
